<title>UK: Try Group boosts order book.</title>
<headline>Try Group boosts order book.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British contractor and housebuilder Try Group Plc said on Tuesday that its contracting order book was boosted by 35 million stg in the last six weeks of 1996 and now stands at 110 million.</p>
<p>It said in a trading statement that the group expects to meet its forecasts for 1996 and added that there are promising signs for 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
